-\>\>\> \(\V{root} \gets n.\V{value}[\pi]\);~ \(k \gets \N{shift\_key}(k)\) \\
-\>\>\> if \(!\V{root}.\V{isroot}\): \\
-\>\>\>\> \(\V{root} \gets n.\V{value}[\pi] \gets \N{true\_root}(\V{root})\) \\
-\>\>\> unlock(\(n\));~ goto descend \\
